&gt;&gt; Laura: THANK YOU SO MUCH,

00:00:05.097 --> 00:00:06.932
GLAD TO HAVE YOU BOTH BACK.

00:00:06.933 --> 00:00:08.900
IN THE TYPE OF NONVIOLENCE WE'VE

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:10.535
BEEN SEEING FROM THE LEFT, IT'S

00:00:10.536 --> 00:00:13.471
NOTHING NEW.

00:00:13.472 --> 00:00:14.906
THE GOVERNOR OF CALIFORNIA WAS

00:00:14.907 --> 00:00:16.074
LOOKING IN THE 1960s AND HE

00:00:16.075 --> 00:00:18.009
HAD HIS OWN WAY OF DEALING WITH

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:18.910
THE PROBLEM.

00:00:18.911 --> 00:00:21.746
JOINING US NOW WITH,

00:00:21.747 --> 00:00:23.315
PRESIDENTIAL HISTORIAN CRAIG

00:00:23.316 --> 00:00:23.648
SHIRLEY.

00:00:23.649 --> 00:00:25.717
I'VE BEEN DYING TO TALK TO YOU,

00:00:25.718 --> 00:00:26.718
AS THE TEMPERATURE IS RISING.

00:00:26.719 --> 00:00:28.119
YOU GET THE SENSE ESPECIALLY

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:30.021
THROUGH SOCIAL MEDIA, THAT'S A

00:00:30.022 --> 00:00:32.357
BIG DIFFERENCE BETWEEN NOW AND

00:00:32.358 --> 00:00:34.626
IN 1969, PEOPLE ARE ABLE TO CALL

00:00:34.627 --> 00:00:40.899
LISTS, CAN COALESCE IN A PLACE

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:41.299
REALLY

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:41.700
FAST.

00:00:41.701 --> 00:00:43.068
HOW DID REAGAN DEAL WITH IT AND

00:00:43.069 --> 00:00:46.104
HOW MIGHT WE LEARN FROM THAT?

00:00:46.105 --> 00:00:48.974
&gt;&gt; HE DEALT WITH IT WITH A LOT

00:00:48.975 --> 00:00:50.175
OF WIT AND GRACE.

00:00:50.176 --> 00:00:54.112
DURING THE VIETNAM WAR HE WAS

00:00:54.113 --> 00:00:55.513
CONFRONTED BY A SMELLY,

00:00:55.514 --> 00:00:57.148
MALODOROUS, DIRTY AND DISHEVELED

00:00:57.149 --> 00:00:57.682
HIPPIE.

00:00:57.683 --> 00:01:00.085
IT MIGHT HAVE BEEN BILL CLINTON,

00:01:00.086 --> 00:01:01.653
BUT THAT HIPPIE WAS CARRYING A

00:01:01.654 --> 00:01:04.856
SIGN THAT SAID, MAKE LOVE, NOT

00:01:04.857 --> 00:01:05.323
ROAR, WAR.

00:01:05.324 --> 00:01:07.192
HE TURNED TO HIS AID AND SAID HE

00:01:07.193 --> 00:01:08.693
COME FROM THE LOOKS OF HIM, I

00:01:08.694 --> 00:01:14.132
DON'T THINK HE WOULD DO EITHER.

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:14.666
&gt;&gt; Laura: [LAUGHS]

00:01:14.667 --> 00:01:16.301
&gt;&gt; IN BERKELEY AGAIN THERE WAS A

00:01:16.302 --> 00:01:18.169
GROUP OF UNRULY STUDENTS OUT

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:22.307
THERE, ANTIWAR PROTESTERS.

00:01:22.308 --> 00:01:23.842
THEY WERE MAKING A SCENE AND

00:01:23.843 --> 00:01:26.277
MAKING THEMSELVES OF OBNOXIOUS.

00:01:26.278 --> 00:01:27.212
REAGAN WROTE ON A PIECE OF PAPER

00:01:27.213 --> 00:01:31.049
AND PUT IT UP TO A SHEET OF

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:33.451
PAPER AND SAID, I'M SELLING MY

00:01:33.452 --> 00:01:33.752
BONDS.

00:01:33.753 --> 00:01:34.919
HE HAD A WAY OF DEALING WITH

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:39.591
THESE THINGS BY TURNING HUMOR TO

00:01:39.592 --> 00:01:41.926
HIS ADVANTAGE, WHICH CAN BE A

00:01:41.927 --> 00:01:42.827
GREAT ASSET IN AMERICAN

00:01:42.828 --> 00:01:43.194
POLITICS.

00:01:43.195 --> 00:01:44.529
&gt;&gt; Laura: IF YOU'VE SEEN TRUMP

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:46.931
IN RECENT DAYS OF THESE RALLIES,

00:01:46.932 --> 00:01:47.732
HE'S ACTUALLY BEEN EXTREMELY

00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:48.033
FUNNY.

00:01:48.034 --> 00:01:52.570
AT THE SAME TIME, IT'S A

00:01:52.571 --> 00:01:54.506
DIFFERENT AND ENVIRONMENT

00:01:54.507 --> 00:01:54.906
MEDIAWISE.

00:01:54.907 --> 00:01:57.475
THE MEDIA WAS AGAINST DRAGON,

00:01:57.476 --> 00:01:58.243
BUT THERE IS SOMETHING DIFFERENT

00:01:58.244 --> 00:02:02.313
ABOUT THE WAY THE CLIPS ON

00:02:02.314 --> 00:02:03.114
SOCIAL MEDIA ARE SHARED.

00:02:03.115 --> 00:02:05.750
THIS IS FROM 1969, AND THIS IS

00:02:05.751 --> 00:02:07.452
IN A PUBLIC MEETING WITH THE

00:02:07.453 --> 00:02:10.288
BERKELEY ADMINISTRATION DURING

00:02:10.289 --> 00:02:11.556
