00:02:11.557 --> 00:02:14.292
LET'S WATCH.

00:02:14.293 --> 00:02:15.894
&gt;&gt; ALL OF IT BEGAN THE FIRST

00:02:15.895 --> 00:02:17.362
TIME SOME OF YOU WHO KNOW BETTER

00:02:17.363 --> 00:02:18.063
AND ARE OLD ENOUGH TO KNOW

00:02:18.064 --> 00:02:20.899
BETTER BUT THEN PEOPLE, YOUNG

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.333
PEOPLE THINK THAT THEY HAD THE

00:02:22.334 --> 00:02:23.701
RIGHT TO CHOOSE THE LAWS THEY

00:02:23.702 --> 00:02:24.903
WOULD OBEY AS LONG AS THEY WERE

00:02:24.904 --> 00:02:27.105
DOING IT IN THE NAME OF SOCIAL

00:02:27.106 --> 00:02:28.706
PROTEST.

00:02:28.707 --> 00:02:31.209
&gt;&gt; IS NOT APPROPRIATE FOR

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:31.709
