00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.244
YOU CAN TRASH SOMETHING AND PULL

00:02:33.245 --> 00:02:34.079
DOWN A STATUE BECAUSE YOU DON'T

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:34.612
LIKE IT.

00:02:34.613 --> 00:02:38.149
GET THE MIDDLE FINGER TO THE

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:39.684
PRESIDENT BECAUSE SOMEONE GAVE

00:02:39.685 --> 00:02:41.319
YOU THE LINES TO SAY?

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:43.254
&gt;&gt; HE BROKE IT DOWN TO HIS

00:02:43.255 --> 00:02:47.092
ELEMENTS, TO HIS COMPONENTS.

00:02:47.093 --> 00:02:49.294
IT WASN'T JUST ABOUT SOCIAL

00:02:49.295 --> 00:02:49.961
