00:02:49.962 --> 00:02:50.895
INJUSTICE.

00:02:50.896 --> 00:02:51.763
THIS IS THE ESSENTIAL DIFFERENCE

00:02:51.764 --> 00:02:53.298
BETWEEN THE TEA PARTY OF SOME

00:02:53.299 --> 00:02:55.500
