00:03:01.507 --> 00:03:02.474
INSTITUTIONS AND THAT'S THE

00:03:02.475 --> 00:03:04.709
ESSENTIAL DIFFERENCE BETWEEN THE

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:04.976
